{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 613,
  "batch_count": 1662,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "c0513553da490a692523f45b5f779f99f6cb7e34",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dbece78601d23488dd7fde9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "努力、辛劳、勤奋，\\n每一样都非常闪亮又甜美☆\\n今天也会好好加油的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e6b6f398cdd9f96c5fb8a1e2aae52c926c4c199222308e78b83a8be18f83456",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "173"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b75d09060ea2cda9a9a0460f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "随着时段的不同，能提升运气的歌\\n也会不一样喔！很有趣吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "89ace7d6f6a95ffb95528d0635128d0d1739e37efd0e488400363063e8996c9a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "174"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abece1c7f5e36a7e11b1a114",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真是时髦的曲风呢……！\\n希望我也可以赶快变成适合这首歌的\\n「都市女孩」～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "071aea0ad2100e17da7ae586b9041ee64c3c58522fa0310d74f18d6c7d1ef22f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "175"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a10820e8da36fb7afea72dc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真是very very nice song呢～！\\n不知道适合配上什么样的舞步？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfcf20d889bdd717d4639c91e54a675ea6fd8367515b0986d2b1e0ca63b3dc62",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "176"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:861be8bb58d290ccc2eb846d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喔喔，心电感应。\\n你竟然刚好挑了\\n小真想听的歌呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a11939d8beb03b5e98e764eecbe9b09896665222e25d16bc9b229da7f935bd65",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "177"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bf1c15cfe831a01ae7d19d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哼、哼哼、哼……♪\\n就像小鸟拍动翅膀的微风般\\n轻快的曲调呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "848dcc7a13263e397ce3c1d0998c8def416590ccc2107cff7adce61a16625d8b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "178"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65206ab3e5f28dacf2ac446f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你喜欢这首歌啊？\\n很感动人心呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcee74e0dbc16b5f9858babe0bd4b4cd4cc8017e988c00004451e665d49b23c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "179"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d49d605e403b9af56dc5a260",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "唔唔……烦恼过头，\\n害我肚子都饿起来了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcbf661b9fc1ab86308a0a796c13f0e4cf0faf902b3c5fa82aa9f64e9a3b8322",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "18"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e7d861cfec65fecea0e9836",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀，有好多首歌呢。\\n我对流行总是很迟钝……\\n你能推荐给我几首吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fdfb4b9e80407f30be29c872ac854baa452e9c06e652ecdbde23124722b4e5b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "180"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d500dfd9f9b8416411abc75e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "众多歌曲所演奏出的故事……\\n训练员，\\n你要不要也试着倾听呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8542f8668dd6143dd3179883d9ec974e4d5d9afcd056073776638df532d8d842",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "181"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f343045fe46b59304f2f270",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "任何旋律我都能即兴\\n改成推广苫小牧的歌词……\\n这就是我的特技喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac555083e7cfc315b54678e065035f151a423c5ff3507938fc519a14339c489d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "182"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f42ed05a3c729a503d01bd73",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "DJ小阳阳！来秀一波吧，\\n手都举起来了吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "612d74619d8f199a576f41dfcd39b5d8027718a0e0ead87e4bf1ea6c27312df3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "183"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13d6134a3c07dbd687fef430",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只能往前冲刺喔耶────！\\n好想再跟大小姐她们热唱一波，\\n一起度过超high的时光～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b032ec633423db8ec72ddcdd6206c83d74d4f84a639e08c7a86db4fcfd788cae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "184"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eaf534a5029d6e2346ea742a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "祈求能够「抵达」──心怀前往\\n自身目标的意志与觉悟，\\n才能踏出毫不动摇的步伐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4dc9d8e4cf187cfaef2c3e8fb95a7c682a5cf995dda7e9acde712312239aa6d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "185"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31b1a36764b8702baa30eb9d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一緒に歌うと、みんなの声がおれに\\n光をくれるんだ。…ずっと先に続く\\n未来を照らしてくれる、そんな光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa3fbd727349785e3634aaf7fcca96084ce7d9b90b525ca187b7bad1eb1d0c8a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "186"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70ce96865b4326387ece3a4f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这个音色，对我而言很特别。就像在\\n我心中呼啸而过后，留下了久久不散\\n的余韵般……是很重要的一首歌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7904a02835e82f0cf91a4138f421c0e122c5587b85c2cf27bac1a9440fc639b3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "187"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4caf40bfa6e69678a713fb61",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你要挑一首适合伟大风风的\\n超～帅气的歌喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73282bfbe829f4672e19f4f84435cb5d642260fd8ff4dd7e68ba0850eec68382",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "188"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f41b94a81267cb17a490586",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喔，是这首歌啊。\\n嗯，即便现在听也很有共鸣呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "897d9ac7585c61a3738ab064ad0461ac2d5df7715c592e179ef8b62805eaa0b1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "189"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:641b769299d8d987865a251f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一听到这首歌啊，\\n就忍不住会想起那句谚语。\\n就是那句「有二不见得有三」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01c33847aef370f4da3ff4045e34647daad8d00a56ac8b46f1523535c827851b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a381b145b735d6cb6e63759",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以让人把涡轮全开的歌最棒了！\\n用超大音量来播吧！超大音量！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0753d1d36fedf59f17fee4f7372dd445c268d28b615952884d62f7c2cb7d1287",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "190"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83f0e7a3b0696ce37508d9b8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好有「都市女孩」风格的歌呀。\\n真令人憧憬……总有一天我要变得\\n配得上这首歌，闪亮亮地唱出来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4b8fc819db50509fe5c604e605e35f4b7715e8c90382bf70873d4c0a23092da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "191"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca42f17ae1028c80ac678a83",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我因为dance break而热血沸腾，\\n侧翻到舞台边幕的那天……\\n观众们都被我逗得超excited！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a77805d7474451a740552218fd58139207ac2a040cdc02b586616b17a4179e7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "192"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0b90457210d48b984cd9e55",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为了理解歌曲的世界观，\\n小真面对了自己的本能……\\n感受力更丰富了。Let's exercise。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96a636d3eb88ab12787b00bd73a24a1d11ee4fd8a1faad55708c3cd411f23eef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "193"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46f1d6fd55aaf327de00aae0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在赛场上奔驰的烈风，\\n这次伴随着乐音吹拂……\\n那是为了分享最快速的喜悦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4b22b2e55abfedbb0d3042585110b770e56df510091618afa4a6d94e5470c49",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "194"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:330977506b97074490c11086",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有个动作是对观众比出小指对吧？\\n我要故意对兴致低迷的观众比……\\n如果对方举手响应……就是我赢了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1927db32e443d189bb2ac9088d7f6c2552e90e32ea55e1a13426f3105a6e922",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "195"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53b0fbfd00fc856eee3f32f5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最近的歌曲，都又快又难呢。\\n不过，这是我想好好演唱的歌。\\n我也得进化才行呢……加油～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "299d73b0adc02211c095a01894d9929c69b7fd42905d15a8aa5ca1864d97c44b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "196"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4e2bb88bbaea881aa66437a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就像成为英雄传奇的主角一样……\\n率真又强烈的歌词和旋律。\\n……这首歌激发了我的勇气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5decb2cad173031968c70262dcea4ff18f2af78cfbe93fc1c68c5e6726e8ee59",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "197"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81496bd8050e9d8e87b42e43",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没错，你就是目击证人。\\n要见证苫小牧今后的跃进……！\\n好，今天的宣传也加油呗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcab45d847c2b3f857b2d3cd06292e6f0d620d76d48bab8e067be3da28d8aaf5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "198"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eececf4da62c325806a2fc7c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这个声音真的很刺激本能耶～！\\n让人想要超越最快，变得更快！所以\\n倍速爆快模式来啰☆Here we go♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "372699436d55bd466fd5d4d342744d6b6bc795679026524f1e522a7d475f50ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "199"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dee25f25853268dfe77dd177",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实，这首好像是\\n妈妈最喜欢的歌曲！看到我唱的时候\\n是她哭得最厉害的一次……欸嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50c75f7bebbde2fab869024734ddad0080b57b7a107cc58c72e976995868f074",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b57855b52d196ae6a922db1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "录这首歌的时候，因为赤骥和\\n伏特加吵了起来所以很辛苦。\\n真是的，幸好有带鱼网。",
      "source_fingerprint": "192d3f2a875de21a006c35acb781a0bb98c957583b09145f7d9f3c47315a410d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb087147e635cc3024e04ef6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「烙下印记吧」……不～对！\\n被咬住不放才更难忘啦！！\\n你只准看着风风喔──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4ba5063ece26ecc00e4a121890abb16cf16d7433a3093ab7ecafb2ab761ec7c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8863b0a4dcf943dbdcd791d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我没打算停下脚步喔。\\n因为自由的景色是没有尽头的。\\n我要继续跑下去……你打算怎么做？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a54a451504c6cbe6e5f69e83f7f3cdca7d153b888afb2a987404d4fc3134de78",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5116339bdb8167172d8b4da4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛马娘哟♪赛马娘哟♪\\n训练员也一起跳～！\\n赛马娘蹦♪赛马娘跳♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1784fa95e2feff53230d00a045b4233a16cc2b63973389d85f5ccf021bf3e0e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7789fc33e45b53d63439f2f0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在派对上放这首歌的话，\\n就会有Lucky☆又兴奋的幸福感，\\n那天会变成最棒的一天喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bc71998826dcb508595b0aa57250498a8b6b7a80b18cb364f8192605cb83034",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dae9370ded7d4e734305481",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "叮当、叮当、叮当……♪\\n哎呀，身体自然地跟着摇摆……\\n呵呵，你也露出了很棒的笑容喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6714a2674707aa819065bf3e8c4209d538b9f782f5311afa6d4506db9db07d29",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:faefd3f8cf96312189d776a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想不到会由我们来唱圣诞歌！如果能\\n散发光芒掳获合家大小的心……\\n我提议表演TOMAKOMAGIC！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7a52dca648fc363227cee4ff98304cf2c5b4217c42577178cfa1eb413dbc7ea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8da571520d8ef6044c0fcc9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "超越时代的心愿……身为受托者，\\n我的决心更加坚定了。\\n为了不忘记，我会时时哼唱……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b0a3163a0d272b5fad4a10828571959c8e8304b3ab781bc38e4ff35d1f16a39",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad9e507d7c1dbddde1ce33d6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Everlasting…歴史とは想いの\\n連鎖で繋がるもの。どんな逆境が\\n訪れようと、私も成してみせるわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7ebd314f3eada9fc64f3e77bf88b64c5a81dbb5b416131f0df39b42adc5cf16",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a4f1d63b173cdfaa283a7d7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我听着这首歌沿河岸散步，\\n不知不觉就走到海边了。\\n这首歌很适合在白天散步时听呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f752ff09dd21d683fa108a9c9d0018750dbb6e562d524203067b8e015083ce99",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7d87527c47d70f143568b25",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "涡轮要做MV的话……就要用荧光绿！\\n还要塞满闪亮的特效！\\n描绘在各种世界里旅行的涡轮！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9ba629da9edb3f1b761d9bb752534736bbbf9b0c91dfd22ca46f5357d305710",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc424909f2c455c0ba04d24e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为要把比目鱼和鲽鱼当棋子用来\\n下黑白棋，所以BGM就拜托你了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6765b3b9af82a1b13bfa29976f37f15b75a8853a2b65933a0d291508d4dd1958",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "21"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:927c72a73c5403d6f85ef685",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我在奔跑时的心情，就如同这首\\n歌词中所写的……想要响应期待时，\\n就会成为我努力的动力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "755f84fe001398bf32d141d70126b71e8febc15d1b559d1aa18b6de5bff9f3c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5007cf496a49095f4ac72182",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我在舞蹈练习时，\\n会配合种类广泛的歌曲练习。\\n我已经习惯这种曲风了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8de35b6c792ecd9855beca7c2093bb46c03a382822eac6adf3761f17afe8dfef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d25b1f2595b55733ea2d8eb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我──并不讨厌音乐。\\n但──也并不是很了解。\\n你喜欢的歌曲是──哪一首？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ce8fef16cfad0af74fe9e3b6da28f7e2de6efffa4ca1c73256babb2e86532f7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6292bffc340cad6301afe9dc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就算是沮丧的时候，\\n只要听最喜欢的歌就能得到激励！\\n请告诉我你喜欢的歌曲吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "73f56e088485d04b4322f7af3538a9799eac13f30871ee81b41c53821d1104e5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18e820fe31f6be164aef2537",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "频率传达到了「内心的波纹」……\\n也就是「STRC」、「通讯」呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78c0e1ece0e5b2ca751d3af3882be1247c42d4a814a86937680e75294153fb15",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1e6cfb40695db53dd35c613",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "前几天我和成田路她们\\n一起在剧场上演唱了这首歌喔！\\n在那名为卡拉OK的剧场！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bbe9443b52acc1f4d0c42b8620976f8a07fa5817c32a840ca923dd71489d54b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5587c7a328fc805ffdc4511b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好歌剧一直死缠烂打地邀请我，\\n说要「用这首歌来进行\\n特别合唱公演！」……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dd60f0ca52e77b7f8abecba1ccd37b2e2bf332f58ec48344d78a7d055f9b5a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c4ee63c307e3ef609711e18",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「Running to the top!」\\n我特别喜欢这句歌词！\\n因为可以激发我的干劲！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3800986443a4da2fbfb8ef1781094ea62c0a76b5cf9dc0029257439dde41130a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7de61b307321bcf94b8e939a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有很多很棒的歌曲呢～\\n……啊，不行不行。一个不注意，\\n就会不小心一直听下去了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "61f55bb1c95dc4e13e2ebca0ce9a73c98c4128905d3daee550554bdb4bcc470e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cfaa43b7cfce8e24b30992b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "音乐能进一步为美酒增色，\\n让其更加鲜明。\\n是最棒的香料……就是这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0fd274c4d351c706ec9b333c5c6fa4d1e0b1a14ed7e23dfe8fa9162b2631c0e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe22df5662476b40ceb2f786",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯！果然速度才是最重要的呢！\\n今后也全力运转引擎继续冲刺吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "72955f7fa6628affe8f63f2b2a60bdc00b62156b66f8f3fa7995e4f4adcbbcbd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "22"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c625091561d7f0045360c7f6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "音乐中是承载有回忆的喔☆★\\n训练员会对哪一首歌曲，\\n唤起怎么样的回忆呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "57f032031ab1585c66d306443f8ea2ced3c26bb0b7f32aac85bbbacf5643809d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f5b5e2fe38fbaa96b153b02",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我喜欢风格强烈的热血歌曲，\\n用丹田发力大声唱\\n感觉非常舒畅喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b16dd361ce221fc5b57959b9a2fc857bcd8de308de80c789b9e7a8dc93f32ddd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adf5db19ed8216b46d876faf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你喜欢这首歌吗？\\n哦……\\n没有啊？没什么啦……呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "301a836e28f33a81746b1b6d37c4456e11d58226736d0347e518509e89a91896",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2d62d404e5afec0de602dfc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我常听节奏轻快的歌！\\n边跑边听这种歌，\\n心情会很棒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1757726a81f0f904c39dec56bdb8660848d851f8de251820cf4c743deeca2c23",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38afb7af77b79c6ddfc6fa30",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "──能与我继承的珍贵血统\\n匹配的最快称号……\\n只有一个。",
      "source_fingerprint": "831f21c06c581cfb250e074a2c0255405f3b530d733f56ba3925e0379463ad9f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cf5331218c86e82da6015cb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Frontier──开创光荣之路，\\n前进──迈向下一场胜利──\\n这就是我的Mission。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2cf1f8b22c1271838dd838cbc0c0676f2cf4e76fbf1036811db258f300eb169",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50f3eb08530eb7130b5d498b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "每次听这首歌，对我向往的舞台\\n就更加热血沸腾♪\\n全世界给我等着～！嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8862a6d9978faeb074366ac9d20949e59d3e484b530e65f106766eebdb70be99",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d133788a40f3fd3e0d4e4f30",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "确认到地球外「通讯」。\\n基于「首要原则」发往「地球」。\\n可别错过……「流星痕」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f3001e049d5566c0e4afb710dda7d076507945f4c8a5713e647771b942de372",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f88e5265383d9c8ef5e274a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听见这首歌，感觉或许～\\n连我也能闪亮耀眼！啊，\\n只是感觉可以而已，嘿嘿嘿！",
      "source_fingerprint": "354f2cddcfaa8e0a2b12fcad03d0a428d4bad210c63886b940046dd889914372",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f7be9cd5150d6e70b046445",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "诗歌属于胜利者……所以我歌颂。\\n然后有一天，编织好的诗歌\\n会唱出属于我的历史……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f51a81bda9b947a30e86ff598e06f89afd17c69b7eaa9dc32b56f3a87197cbcb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b654187929aeadcf735627a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "副歌真的精彩到让人受不了耶～！\\n充分展现出了白仁前辈那\\n「炽烈的灵魂」……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "244375433e7d119615adf2b7973d61bcc0fdf29b66de108d3cb660e690ba85b1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "23"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95a1657865d587d84817d07b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在圆形舞台上被大家团团包围～\\n边唱边跳一起欢笑！\\n这样一定非常美丽☆★☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e08fb44138ead66a27cd9e0ca56c61b4a5aaa9b2f38e9293bf700ba54fba1462",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "230"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e89e0101b52715cee4eaa3ba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不论对手多强或是否备受期待，\\n我都能逆转获胜！\\n……这首歌就给我这样的勇气！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7016663940f8285e9787e0ee994080a3460f8a39e26487da8571d6aedf65211a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "231"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a568e8ab99fb897b16d380be",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只有我会在观众眼中烙下印象……\\n反正终究是场独脚戏，\\n不如由我独自起舞吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4a64ab96428c6c7f39c11f8f8ed735f0d3723da5bf3eea80190736834888f73",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "232"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32404670fadd7ceb2d3fcb55",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如果要在舞台上唱这首歌……\\n希望能站在中间唱──不！\\n我要求让我站在中央演唱！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b8a426dc1c15ac725468926171d8cee94974c95c3296ce5e2196c891b00a0a8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "233"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66193f1625124cf8f26c30fe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这首歌中「宛如不停歇的风」的\\n这个部分……\\n根本就是为我而写的嘛──",
      "source_fingerprint": "692d4159251a6974be20f1499046214c745941dba949e3c765dadf268c9290b0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "234"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c2fc60f2202d938519d4ede",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我经常在训练前听这首歌。\\n宛如不停歇的风……\\n觉得干劲都涌上来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f079efdd9db261a6d30150bdb7a89489c5598f7d8252203098ca0c7fd9a4a400",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "235"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:131678e6b0b8080c0c87e0fe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听见这首歌……就浮现某人的\\n面孔……会觉得现在不是\\n停下脚步的时候，必须冲刺！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8f0a12bd422e7d695f223bf557efc0f063f935396a675d1732de20c0f3187a9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "236"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdd23c7828b0e9657de00ead",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听这首歌……让我想起一直\\n支持我的那位……我最重视、\\n无可取代的同伴……",
      "source_fingerprint": "af55f8ff6b83989032aa7d18881f6e79eaecc280d1e900ec54a3419d65dcfdfe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "237"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88a74ff6a6cf440796e4c49b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "睡觉前听这首歌，可以放松心情\\n愉快入睡。搭配招财猫和\\n眼罩使用的效果更棒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "71ff9e4bfaca76316f21bb1af51478a765cea4b19cf2331cbed1f923e3a70881",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "238"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de71d8c62d4c55dd72ab5774",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "难得的休假，必须像这首歌一样\\n充分让身心休憩……\\n但可不能太过松懈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c636eb56055935f7269190f40dfd775e47a236a175d9eac1cb44b7d5ef5d67d3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "239"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f1a24d166c6671e9a2a7c9b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哦，要来听歌吗？\\n全都是些很帅气的歌曲喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1671c8670070da72fc054388e27d2d758a85639c0603f7bf4818ca05a8e9a98e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "24"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58d6365401c1d6c5eadc032f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真的假的……已经发布了……？\\n歌曲的封面……是以我为中心……\\n这是什么时候的事情……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c9a33ce1d64a3f54edaa6570df9497fda80de3c2f45b89e984a1e3c8dbb3baa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "240"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70a7b822f44e6ba2059cb8cc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想起大家曾经一起在\\n傍晚时分的河堤边和\\n商店街唱过这首歌～",
      "source_fingerprint": "00819f621112eaf3aec0f96596a28ed7da3a0f717ed607db91105fa576b88801",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "241"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c66cb7359c4e01a804d8432a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如果想打扮得更有个性，\\n建议佩带帽子！若有需要，\\n我可以帮忙挑选！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bb917143f48e5233aeefb33e17bb34beeb92585d228bf7c73dbe228156f96dd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "242"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d93f8497aa22f9657190f74d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有没有感受到帽子的威能？\\n帽子果然具备\\n赋予活力的能力～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e69415acf7f2d8eb97f435466570291c3a5d7a44868d9b5edd8ae00bba666c32",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "243"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d76510485c22817b4b4d49d9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如何？超嗨的急速感很酷吧？\\n耳朵是不是焕然一新？\\n果然只有辣妹才赢得了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59e867b6e44e32c38bf1a9c818c26553d37207ea718b0c332f29ccae2013faef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "244"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
